msgstr ""
"La autenticación falló porque la ventana de entrada PIN fue detectada "
"cerrada, intenta de nuevo."

#: static/gentelella/js/base/digital_signature.js:1078
msgid ""
"The device was disconnected, possibly the window was closed for signature. "
